                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Summary of local situation",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "bold"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": " ",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "1,534 cases are currently warded in hospital. 297 cases require oxygen supplementation and 40 are in the intensive care unit (ICU).  ",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Over the last 28 days, of the 46,637 infected individuals, 98.4% had no or mild symptoms, 1.3% required oxygen supplementation, 0.1% required ICU care, and 0.2% has died.  ",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "As of 6 October 2021, 83% of our population has completed their full regimen/ received two doses of COVID-19 vaccines, and 85% has received at least one dose.  ",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "As of 7 October 2021, 12pm, the Ministry of Health has detected a total of 3,483 new cases of COVID-19 infection in Singapore, with 2,783 in the community, 692 in the migrant worker dormitories and 8 imported cases.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "text": "Condition of hospitalised cases",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "As of 7 October 2021, 12pm, 1,534 COVID-19 cases are currently warded in hospital. Most are well and under observation. There are currently 297 cases requiring oxygen supplementation, and 40 in the ICU. Of those who have fallen very ill, 281 are seniors above 60 years.  ",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "2. 3 more cases have passed away from complications due to COVID-19 infection.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "1 ",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "superscript"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Of these, 2 were male Singaporeans and 1 was a female Singaporean, aged between 57 and 90 years. Amongst them, 1 had been unvaccinated against COVID-19, and 2 had been vaccinated. All of them had various underlying medical conditions. In total, 136 have passed away from complications due to COVID-19 infection.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Figure 1:",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "underline"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " Number of Active Cases in ICU or Requiring Oxygen Supplementation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text",
