          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "3. Over the last 28 days, the percentage of local cases who were asymptomatic or had mild symptoms is 98.4%. 628 cases required oxygen supplementation and 61 had been in the ICU. Of these, 49.5% were fully vaccinated and 50.5% were unvaccinated/ partially vaccinated. 72 have died, of whom 31.9% were fully vaccinated and 68.1% were unvaccinated/ partially vaccinated. ",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
